[62.424525, "o", "\u001b[34mi \u001b[35mFaster guest checkout\u001b[34m \u001b[90mAccepted\u001b[34m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mi Guests abandon checkout when it hangs\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mi 2.93 value per review hour (value 22, 6 h, confidence 0.8)\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mi 3 signals, 3 customers, 6500/month, 2 urgent\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mi   - p95 checkout latency above 4s\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mi   - Checkout spinner never ends for guests (Initech)\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[34mi   - Guest checkout times out on mobile (Globex)\u001b[39m\r\n"]
